  "description": "The KS-13 is a robust keyboard stand that looks great and is simple to use. The table-style platform works with a variety of instrument types, from lightweight synthesizers to heavy 88-key stage pianos. Angled legs provide rock-solid stability with plenty of clearance underneath, and you can easily adjust the width and height for your ideal playing comfort.\n\nThe KS-13 allows you to make core stand adjustments without needing tools. Grab the quick-release lever to set the proper width for the keyboard you want to use. Then use the knobs on each leg to access three height settings to suit your situation.\n\nWhen you place your instrument on the KS-13, it\u2019s supported with four large rubber grommets that eliminate movement while playing heavy rhythms, glissandos, and dynamic solos. And with the adjustable feet, you can dial in the legs for wobble-free operation on uneven floors.\n\nThe KS-13 breaks down quickly for transportation and storage. Fold down the left/right leg pairs for carrying to the gig or stowing in a closet. Then swing them out and lock them in place when it\u2019s time to play.\n\nFast Adjustment\n\nMaximum Stability\n\nFolding Design",
